{
  "_comment": "Deterministic guard for the shipped guidance. must_contain phrases are measured facts the agent must be able to read; must_not_contain are regressions. Checked by tests/test_guidance_guard.py against the text the MCP serves (sdk_knowledge_get) and the skill references.",
